00:17:06,417 --> 00:17:12,199
[SPEAKER_00]: So, the hindrances are now seen as... As belonging to the body that doesn't belong to you.

271
00:17:12,219 --> 00:17:12,760
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, exactly.

272
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:14,160
[SPEAKER_01]: That's what I wanted to say, yeah.

273
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:15,701
[SPEAKER_01]: Which means they don't hinder you anymore.

274
00:17:15,781 --> 00:17:15,981
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

