279
00:17:23,423 --> 00:17:24,964
[SPEAKER_01]: They're fully bound up and rooted in the body.

280
00:17:24,984 --> 00:17:25,704
[SPEAKER_01]: And they always were.

281
00:17:27,025 --> 00:17:30,606
[SPEAKER_01]: That's why recognition of that, full understanding of that, frees you from them forever.

282
