283
00:17:33,787 --> 00:17:36,368
[SPEAKER_01]: Initially, yeah, you have to keep looking at it to be free from it.

284
00:17:37,009 --> 00:17:41,590
[SPEAKER_01]: Once you fully understood hindrances... That's why arahant is the destroyer of the hindrances.

285
00:17:42,351 --> 00:17:45,372
