00:18:17,862 --> 00:18:20,363
[SPEAKER_01]: Jhāna is a particular type of mindfulness of the body.

300
00:18:21,784 --> 00:18:26,928
[SPEAKER_01]: That's where the body witness is the one who has developed the whole jhāna practice.

301
00:18:28,229 --> 00:18:29,309
[SPEAKER_00]: It's the same principle, sure.

302
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:37,773
[SPEAKER_01]: So, it's mindfulness of the body, particularly directed.

303
00:18:38,133 --> 00:18:39,314
[SPEAKER_01]: That's how you practice jhāna.

304
00:18:40,415 --> 00:18:44,739
[SPEAKER_01]: And particular direction is the direction of... Yeah.

305
00:18:44,839 --> 00:18:53,386
