[SPEAKER_01]: How is taking up of the body perpetuated?

309
00:19:03,398 --> 00:19:04,319
[SPEAKER_01]: How is it manifested?

310
00:19:05,241 --> 00:19:06,422
[SPEAKER_00]: That's just the natural state.

311
00:19:06,442 --> 00:19:07,103
[SPEAKER_00]: It's just ignorance.

312
00:19:07,163 --> 00:19:09,666
[SPEAKER_01]: It's just the... No, but ignorance needs maintenance.

313
00:19:10,267 --> 00:19:11,469
[SPEAKER_00]: Ignorance is not a static thing.

