319
00:19:38,135 --> 00:19:38,315
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

320
00:19:38,335 --> 00:19:41,117
[SPEAKER_01]: Can those things be perpetuated without intention behind it?

321
00:19:41,837 --> 00:19:42,077
[SPEAKER_00]: No.

322
00:19:43,158 --> 00:19:49,262
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you're basically taking up the body by acting with the body.

323
00:19:50,633 --> 00:19:51,934
