324
00:19:52,114 --> 00:19:52,694
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

325
00:19:53,294 --> 00:19:54,835
[SPEAKER_01]: Ignorant intentions in regard to the body.

326
00:19:55,175 --> 00:19:56,475
[SPEAKER_01]: So, how do you act with the body?

327
00:19:58,376 --> 00:19:59,996
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, you act like this, you act like that.

328
00:20:00,837 --> 00:20:06,259
[SPEAKER_01]: So, first, you need to start restraining the body, in terms of obvious unwholesome things.

329
00:20:06,379 --> 00:20:06,599
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

330
00:20:07,239 --> 00:20:13,501
[SPEAKER_01]: Obvious sensuality, obvious ill-will, obvious distraction, obvious unskillful states.

331
00:20:14,261 --> 00:20:16,202
[SPEAKER_00]: Precepts, sensual strikes.

