[SPEAKER_01]: Doing things with the body.

339
00:20:25,635 --> 00:20:44,587
[SPEAKER_01]: You know, you can have mind raging with your will, or sensuality, but if the body remains there, left alone, you're not giving in to the pressure to act with it, there is no expression of that, which means whatever unwholesome is, it's not in the domain of the body, because you're not doing it.

340
00:20:44,827 --> 00:20:47,169
[SPEAKER_01]: But it could be in the domain of speech or mind.

341
00:20:47,449 --> 00:20:48,189
[SPEAKER_01]: That's the second bit.

342
00:20:48,490 --> 00:20:55,074
[SPEAKER_01]: So, see, it's kind of more obvious for people to see, okay, bodily actions are bodily, and mental actions are mental.

343
00:20:55,134 --> 00:20:55,374
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

