00:21:09,946 --> 00:21:11,868
[SPEAKER_01]: How is... How is speech possible?

351
00:21:11,988 --> 00:21:12,528
[SPEAKER_01]: ... possible?

352
00:21:13,329 --> 00:21:16,271
[SPEAKER_01]: You can't speak without thoughts of speaking.

