00:21:16,351 --> 00:21:16,952
[SPEAKER_01]: No, exactly.

354
00:21:17,252 --> 00:21:18,233
[SPEAKER_01]: It's just inconceivable.

355
00:21:18,633 --> 00:21:24,058
[SPEAKER_01]: Yet, thoughts of speaking, even verbal, loud thoughts in your mind, are not the speech.

356
00:21:25,012 --> 00:21:27,474
[SPEAKER_01]: Because if that were the speech the Guru has said, that's the speech.

357
00:21:27,514 --> 00:21:31,417
[SPEAKER_01]: He said, speech is when you break into speech physically.

